hand-rolled glass), every visible string from Localizable.xcstrings with web key names, full VoiceOver
labels/traits, Dynamic Type, light/dark + increased-contrast tokens, and deep-linkable via the new
.apiLogs route. Verified on BOTH idioms by isolated Swift 6 strict-concurrency type-checks (macOS 0 /
iOS 0) and an executed model harness (30/30); the full app target additionally type-checked every one
